{"suttaId":"an6.106","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"A-vi","vriCode":"s0403m2.mul","paras":[807,813],"vripara":"106"},"segments":{"an6.106:0.3":"Taṇhāsuttaṃ","an6.106:1.1":"“Tisso imā, bhikkhave, taṇhā pahātabbā, tayo ca mānā.","an6.106:1.2":"Katamā tisso taṇhā pahātabbā?","an6.106:1.3":"Kāmataṇhā, bhavataṇhā, vibhavataṇhā –","an6.106:1.4":"imā tisso taṇhā pahātabbā.","an6.106:1.5":"Katame tayo mānā pahātabbā?","an6.106:1.6":"Māno, omāno, atimāno –","an6.106:1.7":"ime tayo mānā pahātabbā.","an6.106:1.8":"Yato kho, bhikkhave, bhikkhuno imā tisso taṇhā pahīnā honti, ime ca tayo mānā;","an6.106:1.9":"ayaṃ vuccati, bhikkhave, bhikkhu acchecchi taṇhaṃ, vivattayi saṃyojanaṃ, sammā mānābhisamayā antamakāsi dukkhassā”ti.","an6.106:1.10":"Ekādasamaṃ.","an6.106:1.11":"Ānisaṃsavaggo dasamo. [pañcamo (syā. ka.)]","an6.106:2.0":"Tassuddānaṃ –","an6.106:2.1":"Pātubhāvo ānisaṃso,","an6.106:2.2":"aniccadukkhaanattato;","an6.106:2.3":"Nibbānaṃ anavatthi,","an6.106:2.4":"ukkhittāsi atammayo;","an6.106:2.5":"Bhavā taṇhāyekā dasāti.","an6.106:2.6":"Dutiyapaṇṇāsakaṃ samattaṃ. 11."},"unsure":[],"preface":[],"attha":null,"tika":{"book":"Mp-t-vi","bookName":"Chakkanipāta-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0403t.tik","from":785,"to":787,"paras":[{"para":785,"vripara":"96-106","refs":["an6.106:1"],"lines":["Dasamassa paṭhamādīsu natthi vattabbaṃ.","Aṭṭhame mettā etassa atthīti mettāvā, tassa bhāvo <b>mettāvatā,</b> mettāpaṭipatti, tāya.","Sā pana mettāvatā mettāvasena pāricariyāti āha <b>“mettāyuttāya pāricariyāyā”</b>ti.","<b>Paricaranti</b> vippakatabrahmacariyattā.","Pariciṇṇasatthukena sāvakena nāma satthuno yāva dhammena kātabbā pāricariyā, tāya sammadeva sampāditattā.","Navamādīni uttānatthāni."],"lineRefs":[["an6.106:1"],["an6.106:1"],["an6.106:1"],["an6.106:1"],["an6.106:1"],["an6.106:1"]]},{"para":786,"vripara":null,"refs":["an6.106:1"],"lines":["Pātubhāvasuttādivaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["an6.106:1"]]},{"para":787,"vripara":null,"refs":["an6.106:1"],"lines":["Ānisaṃsavaggavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā. 107-116."],"lineRefs":[["an6.106:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika2":null}
